---
import NewsPills from "../components/NewsPills.tsx";
import StarRating from "../components/StarRating.tsx";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Comunidad de tatuadores de Cochabamba, Bolivia. Encuentra artistas, estilos y agenda tu próxima cita.">
<title>Llajtattoo | Comunidad de tatuadores</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/globals.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styleguide.css">
<script is:inline src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<script is:inline>
tailwind.config = {
      corePlugins: {
        preflight: false
      },
      theme: {
        extend: {
          boxShadow: {
            "m3-elevation-light-5": "var(--m3-elevation-light-5)"
          }
        }
      },
      plugins: []
    };
  </script>
</head>
<body class="m-0 bg-white text-black">
<header class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1150px] items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-0 lg:py-6">
<a href="/" class="shrink-0" aria-label="Llajtattoo, ir al inicio">
<img
        class="h-auto w-[72px] object-contain sm:w-[130px] lg:w-[210px]"
        src="/images/logo.png"
        alt="Llajtattoo"
      >
</a>
<nav class="hidden items-center gap-4 lg:flex" aria-label="Navegación principal">
<a href="/" class="font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm font-normal text-[#999999] hover:text-black">Inicio</a>
<a href="/estilos" class="font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm font-normal text-black hover:text-[#999999]">Estilos</a>
<a href="#artistas" class="font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm font-normal text-black hover:text-[#999999]">Artistas</a>
<a href="#unete" class="font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm font-normal text-black hover:text-[#999999]">Únete</a>
<a href="#noticias" class="font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm font-normal text-black hover:text-[#999999]">Blog</a>
</nav>
<form class="hidden items-center rounded-full bg-black px-4 py-2 sm:flex" role="search">
<label for="site-search" class="sr-only">Buscar estilo</label>
<svg class="mr-2 h-4 w-4 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
<circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/>
</svg>
<input
        id="site-search"
        name="search"
        type="search"
        placeholder="Buscar estilo"
        class="w-24 border-0 bg-transparent font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xs text-white outline-none placeholder:text-[#999999] lg:w-32"
      >
</form>
</header>
<main>
<section id="inicio" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1150px] px-4 pb-8 pt-2 sm:px-6 lg:px-0 lg:pb-16 lg:pt-12" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
<div class="grid overflow-hidden border-b border-black/30 bg-white shadow-[0px_4px_4px_#00000040] lg:grid-cols-[1fr_410px]">
<div class="flex min-h-[220px] flex-col justify-center px-5 py-8 sm:px-10 lg:min-h-[500px] lg:px-16">
<h1 id="welcome-title" class="max-w-[620px] font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-2xl font-bold leading-[1.03] sm:text-4xl lg:text-[70px] lg:leading-[72px]">
Bienvenido a nuestra comunidad
          </h1>
<p class="mt-4 max-w-[618px] font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-[10px] font-normal leading-4 text-[#000000b2] sm:text-sm sm:leading-6 lg:mt-8 lg:text-xl lg:leading-[29px]">
Esta página está hecha para ti. Descubre la gran comunidad de tatuadores de Cochabamba, encuentra el estilo que buscas, conecta con tu artista favorito y agenda tu cita. ¡Tu próximo tatuaje comienza aquí!
          </p>
</div>
<img
          class="hidden h-full min-h-[500px] w-full object-cover lg:block"
          src="/images/hero.png"
          alt="Diseño artístico de tatuaje"
        >
<img
          class="block h-28 w-full object-cover object-center lg:hidden"
          src="/images/hero.png"
          alt=""
        >
</div>
</section>

<section id="artistas" class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1150px] px-4 py-8 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-0 lg:py-16" aria-labelledby="artists-title">
<img
        class="pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 hidden w-36 object-contain opacity-50 lg:block"
        src="/images/assets/flower.png"
        alt=""
      >
<h2 id="artists-title" class="font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-2xl font-bold leading-none sm:text-3xl lg:text-[70px] lg:leading-[72px]">
Artistas del mes
      </h2>
<p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[410px] font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-[10px] font-normal leading-4 sm:text-sm sm:leading-6 lg:mt-6 lg:text-base lg:leading-[29px]">
Los artistas más destacados del mes por su participación en la convención de tatuajes en Oruro
      </p>
<div class="mx-auto mt-8 grid max-w-[900px] grid-cols-3 gap-3 sm:gap-10 lg:mt-12">
<article class="flex flex-col items-center">
<img
            class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-[191px] lg:w-[191px]"
            src="/images/assets/Profe Tattoo.png"
            alt="Fabian Morales, Profe Tattoo"
          >
<h3 class="mt-3 font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-[9px] font-bold leading-3 sm:text-sm lg:text-xl lg:leading-[29px]">
Fabian Morales<br>PROFE TATTOO
          </h3>
<a href="#perfil-fabian" class="mt-2 rounded bg-black px-3 py-1 font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-[8px] font-medium text-white hover:bg-black/80 sm:text-xs">
Ver Perfil
          </a>
</article>
<article class="flex flex-col items-center">
<img
            class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-[191px] lg:w-[191px]"
            src="/images/assets/Don Juan Caballero.png"
            alt="Juan Don Juan Caballero"
          >
<h3 class="mt-3 font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-[9px] font-bold leading-3 sm:text-sm lg:text-xl lg:leading-[29px]">
Juan<br>Don Juan Caballero
          </h3>
<a href="#perfil-juan" class="mt-2 rounded bg-black px-3 py-1 font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-[8px] font-medium text-white hover:bg-black/80 sm:text-xs">
Ver Perfil
          </a>
</article>
<article class="flex flex-col items-center">
<img
            class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover sm:h-28 sm:w-28 lg:h-[191px] lg:w-[191px]"
            src="/images/assets/Black Kitty.png"
            alt="Natalia Lazzo, Blackitty"
          >
<h3 class="mt-3 font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-[9px] font-bold leading-3 sm:text-sm lg:text-xl lg:leading-[29px]">
Natalia Lazzo<br>BLACKITTY
          </h3>
<a href="https://www.instagram.com/blackitty.tattoo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-2 rounded bg-black px-3 py-1 font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-[8px] font-medium text-white hover:bg-black/80 sm:text-xs">
Ver Perfil
          </a>
</article>
</div>
</section>

<section id="noticias" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#f3f3f3] px-4 py-9 text-center sm:px-6 lg:py-16" aria-labelledby="news-title">

<img
        class="pointer-events-none absolute left-0 top-0 hidden w-80 opacity-30 lg:block"
        src="/images/assets/flower.png"
        alt=""
        >
<img
    class="pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-2/3 hidden w-80 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-30 lg:block"
    src="/images/assets/flower.png"
    alt=""
    >
<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1150px]">
<h2 id="news-title" class="font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-2xl font-bold leading-none sm:text-3xl lg:text-[70px] lg:leading-[72px]">
Noticias
        </h2>
<p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[740px] font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-[10px] leading-4 sm:text-sm sm:leading-6 lg:mt-6 lg:text-2xl lg:leading-[29px]">
Descubre las últimas tendencias del mundo del tatuaje y entérate de las noticias más importantes sobre eventos, convenciones y festivales de tattoo en Bolivia y alrededor del mundo.
        </p>
<NewsPills client:load />
<a href="#blog" class="mx-auto mt-5 inline-flex min-w-28 justify-center rounded bg-[#07111a] px-32 py-2 font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-xl font-medium text-white shadow-[0px_4px_4px_#00000040] hover:bg-black">
Ingresar
        </a>
</div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1150px] gap-5 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3 lg:px-0 lg:py-20" aria-label="Opciones de la comunidad">
<article class="flex min-h-[270px] flex-col rounded-[30px] bg-[#000000e6] px-6 py-7 text-center text-white shadow-[4px_4px_4px_4px_#00000040] sm:min-h-[400px] lg:rounded-[60px]">
<h2 class="font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-xl font-bold leading-7 sm:text-2xl lg:text-[32px] lg:leading-[40px]">
¿NO SABES QUÉ ESTILO ES EL TATUAJE QUE QUIERES REALIZARTE?
        </h2>
<div class="mt-4 flex flex-1 items-center gap-3 text-left">
<img class="h-28 w-28 rounded-[70px] object-cover sm:h-40 sm:w-28" src="/images/assets/new4.png" alt="Ejemplo de tatuaje">
<p class="font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xs leading-5 sm:text-sm sm:leading-6">
Ingresa a la pestaña de estilos y encuentra el estilo de tu tatuaje con las carecterísticas de cada estilo.
          </p>
</div>
<a href="/estilos" class="mt-4 inline-flex justify-center self-center rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm text-black hover:bg-[#dcdcdc]">
IR A ESTILOS
        </a>
</article>
<article id="unete" class="flex min-h-[270px] flex-col rounded-[30px] bg-[#000000e6] px-6 py-7 text-center text-white shadow-[4px_4px_4px_4px_#00000040] sm:min-h-[400px] lg:rounded-[60px]">
<h2 class="font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-2xl font-bold leading-[72px] sm:text-[32px]">
Eres artista ?
        </h2>
<p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[240px] flex-1 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm leading-6 sm:text-base sm:leading-[29px]">
Únete a nuestra comunidad de artistas, conecta con nuevos clientes y disfruta de todos los beneficios que ofrece nuestra plataforma.
        </p>
<a href="#aplicar" class="mt-5 inline-flex justify-center self-center rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-sm font-medium text-black hover:bg-[#dcdcdc]">
APLICAR AHORA
        </a>
</article>
<article class="flex min-h-[270px] flex-col rounded-[30px] bg-[#000000e6] px-6 py-7 text-center text-white shadow-[4px_4px_4px_4px_#00000040] sm:min-h-[400px] lg:rounded-[60px]">
<h2 class="font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-xl font-bold leading-7 sm:text-2xl lg:text-[32px] lg:leading-[39px]">
¡ESTE TATUADOR ESTÁ DE PROMOCIÓN ESTE MES!
        </h2>
<p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[280px] font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-sm font-bold leading-6 sm:text-base sm:leading-[30px]">
ingresa a su perfil para ver su trabajo y conocer más sobre ella
        </p>
<img class="mx-auto mt-4 h-24 w-24 rounded-full object-cover sm:h-36 sm:w-36" src="/images/assets/Black Kitty.png" alt="Tatuadora en promoción">
<a href="https://www.instagram.com/blackitty.tattoo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-5 inline-flex justify-center self-center rounded-full bg-[#f629b5] px-6 py-3 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xl text-white hover:bg-[#df159f] sm:text-2xl">
2 X 1 FINELINE
        </a>
</article>
</section>

<section id="estilos" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1150px] px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-0 lg:py-16" aria-labelledby="styles-title">
<h2 id="styles-title" class="text-center font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-2xl font-bold leading-none sm:text-3xl lg:text-[70px] lg:leading-[72px]">
Explorar por estilos
      </h2>
<div class="mx-auto mt-8 grid max-w-[965px] grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:mt-12 lg:gap-10">
<article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#000000e8] p-3 text-center text-white lg:rounded-[30px]">
<img class="mx-auto h-24 w-24 object-cover sm:h-40 sm:w-40 lg:h-[210px] lg:w-[210px]" src="/images/assets/traditional-home.png" alt="Tatuaje tradicional">
<h3 class="mt-3 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-base font-bold">Estilo</h3>
<p class="mt-1 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm">tradicional</p>
<a href="#tradicional" class="mt-4 flex h-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#dcdcdc] font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xs font-bold text-black hover:bg-white">INGRESAR</a>
</article>
<article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#000000e8] p-3 text-center text-white lg:rounded-[30px]">
<img class="mx-auto h-24 w-24 object-cover sm:h-40 sm:w-40 lg:h-[201px] lg:w-[201px]" src="/images/assets/fine-line-home.png" alt="Tatuaje fine line">
<h3 class="mt-3 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-base font-bold">Estilo</h3>
<p class="mt-1 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm">Fine line</p>
<a href="#fineline" class="mt-4 flex h-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#dcdcdc] font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xs font-bold text-black hover:bg-white">INGRESAR</a>
</article>
<article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#000000e8] p-3 text-center text-white lg:rounded-[30px]">
<img class="mx-auto h-24 w-24 object-cover sm:h-40 sm:w-40 lg:h-[208px] lg:w-[208px]" src="/images/assets/neo-traditional-home.png" alt="Tatuaje neotradicional">
<h3 class="mt-3 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-base font-bold">Estilo</h3>
<p class="mt-1 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm">Neotradicional</p>
<a href="#neotradicional" class="mt-4 flex h-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#dcdcdc] font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xs font-bold text-black hover:bg-white">INGRESAR</a>
</article>
<article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#000000e8] p-3 text-center text-white lg:rounded-[30px]">
<img class="mx-auto h-24 w-24 object-cover sm:h-40 sm:w-40 lg:h-[201px] lg:w-[202px]" src="/images/assets/blackwork.png" alt="Tatuaje blackwork">
<h3 class="mt-3 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-base font-bold">Estilo</h3>
<p class="mt-1 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm">Blackwork</p>
<a href="#blackwork" class="mt-4 flex h-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#dcdcdc] font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xs font-bold text-black hover:bg-white">INGRESAR</a>
</article>
<article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#000000e8] p-3 text-center text-white lg:rounded-[30px]">
<img class="mx-auto h-24 w-24 object-cover sm:h-40 sm:w-40 lg:h-[220px] lg:w-[220px]" src="/images/assets/realism1-home.png" alt="Tatuaje realista">
<h3 class="mt-3 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-base font-bold">Estilo</h3>
<p class="mt-1 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm">Realismo</p>
<a href="#realismo" class="mt-4 flex h-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#dcdcdc] font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xs font-bold text-black hover:bg-white">INGRESAR</a>
</article>
<article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#000000e8] p-3 text-center text-white lg:rounded-[30px]">
<img class="mx-auto h-24 w-24 object-cover sm:h-40 sm:w-40 lg:h-[197px] lg:w-[197px]" src="/images/assets/realism2-home.png" alt="Tatuaje realista">
<h3 class="mt-3 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-base font-bold">Estilo</h3>
<p class="mt-1 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm">Realismo</p>
<a href="#realismo" class="mt-4 flex h-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#dcdcdc] font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xs font-bold text-black hover:bg-white">INGRESAR</a>
</article>
</div>
</section>

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-black px-4 py-10 text-white sm:px-6 lg:py-20" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
<img class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 left-0 hidden h-full w-auto opacity-20 lg:block" src="/images/assets/flower.png" alt="">
<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1150px]">
<h2 id="steps-title" class="text-center font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-2xl font-bold leading-none sm:text-3xl lg:text-[70px] lg:leading-[72px]">
Tu próximo tatuaje en 3 pasos
        </h2>
<p class="mt-3 text-center font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-xs text-[#ffffffb2] sm:text-sm lg:mt-6 lg:text-xl">
Sigue estos tres pasos para realizarte un tatuaje
        </p>
<ol class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3 lg:mt-32">
<li class="relative rounded-tl-[90px] rounded-br-[90px] rounded-tr-[30px] rounded-bl-[30px] bg-white px-5 pb-5 pt-12 text-center text-black">
<span class="absolute -top-20 left-1/2 flex h-28 w-28 -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white">
    <svg width="96" height="96" viewBox="0 0 96 96"
    fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <path d="M44 16C59.464 16 72 28.536 72 44C72 59.464
    59.464 72 44 72C28.536 72 16 59.464 16 44C16 28.536
    28.536 16 44 16ZM44 27C41.7675 27 39.5567 27.4396
