    fill="#222222"/>
    </svg>
</span>
<h3 class="font-['David_Libre',Helvetica] text-2xl font-bold">AGENDA</h3>
<p class="mt-3 font-['Inter',Helvetica] text-sm leading-6">
Si ya escogiste a tu tatuador, puedes ingresar a sus redes sociales para interactuar con él, enviarle un mensaje y agendar una cita.
            </p>
</li>
<li class="relative rounded-tl-[90px] rounded-br-[90px] rounded-tr-[30px] rounded-bl-[30px] bg-white px-5 pb-5 pt-12 text-center text-black">
<span class="absolute -top-20 left-1/2 flex h-28 w-28 -translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white">
    <svg width="85" height="85" viewBox="0 0 85 85"
    fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <path d="M43.3762 27.4565C46.939 33.1886 51.812 38.0275
    57.6135 41.5522L29.1897 69.9771C28.7647 70.402 28.5523
